<title>THAILAND: Wall Street Finance H1 net edges up.</title>
<headline>Wall Street Finance H1 net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the six months ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Six months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.24     vs	     3.62</p>
